# Context Runtime

This directory stores short-lived local runtime artifacts for planning and execution memory.

Recommended layout:

- `current.md` — session digest
- `runtime/ISSUE-ID/plan.md` — local mirror of `PLAN::ISSUE-ID` (root is `artifacts.planProgressRoot` in `ai.config.yaml`, default `.ai/context/runtime`)
- `runtime/ISSUE-ID/progress.md` — local mirror of `PROGRESS::ISSUE-ID`

If your tracker integration is active, these per-issue files can mirror or supplement tracker comments.
